/Title (The graph captures the resource constraint of the economy but does not fully represent the Ramsey equilibrium, as it lacks the consumption dynamics and saddle path. This limitation arises partly due to the use of limited data and small values of capital, which restrict the ability to accurately construct the full phase diagram. Since the Ramsey model is highly sensitive to parameter values and functional forms, using a finite dataset and approximated capital values makes it difficult to derive the precise steady-state and dynamic adjustment path.)
